<tr><td class="lv">70</td><td><span class="bis">🏆</span> <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joyeuse">Joyeuse</a></strong></td><td>One of the best swords for RDM — high Double Attack proc rate</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">71</td><td><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Ruler">Ruler</a></td><td>Resist Sleep/Silence/Blind/Gravity traits</td></tr>
