<tr><td class="lv">73</td><td><span class="eg">⭐</span> <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Justice_Sword">Justice Sword</a></strong></td><td>Best off-hand sword for sword main-hand RDMs (hard to obtain)</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">73</td><td><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Mensur_Epee">Mensur Epee</a></td><td>Hidden: dmg increases in smaller parties / solo (DMG 47 solo)</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">75</td><td><span class="bis">🏆</span> <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Excalibur">Excalibur</a></strong></td><td>RDM pipe dream relic, but amazing if obtained</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

**Note:** Past lvl 49 it's likely you'll use elemental staves in parties — these swords are for skill-up or soloing. Swords are a B skill for RDM and cap at 250 at lvl 75.

